###### CUSTOMER SELF-SERVICE ######
### Register (public, creates auth account + customer profile)
### Setelah register: login di auth.http dengan email/password ini untuk dapat
### accessToken customer (CUSTOMER_BASE) — dipakai untuk /my/dinings (dining.http §L3).
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Budi Santoso",
    "email": "budi@example.com",
    "password": "password123",
    "phone": "081234567890"
}

### Get My Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update My Profile
PUT {{baseUrl}}/customers/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Budi Santoso",
    "phone": "081234567890",
    "notes": "Alergi kacang"
}


###### CUSTOMER STAFF (cashier/admin) ######
### Create Guest (no login account)
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "name": "Tamu Walk-in",
    "email": "tamu@example.com",
    "phone": "081234567891",
    "notes": "Dine-in meja 5"
}

### Search active or GetAll
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers?keyword=budi
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get by ID
### id ini yang dipakai sebagai customerId di orders.http / dining.http (harus ada, 404 bila tidak)
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update
PUT {{baseUrl}}/customers/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Budi Santoso",
    "phone": "081234567890",
    "notes": "Member gold"
}

### Patch
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/customers/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "phone": "081234567899"
}

### Delete (also soft-deletes linked auth account)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/customers/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
